1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,450
For 20 minutes,

2
00:00:01,510 --> 00:00:03,350
a burning ship drifted through

3
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:05,640
Halifax harbour, and thousands stopped

4
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:07,250
at their windows to watch.

5
00:00:08,023 --> 00:00:09,683
The French ship Mont-Blanc was

6
00:00:09,683 --> 00:00:11,313
full of TNT,

7
00:00:11,333 --> 00:00:13,133
picric acid and benzol,

8
00:00:13,323 --> 00:00:14,653
and had just collided with

9
00:00:14,653 --> 00:00:15,823
the Imo.

10
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:18,240
Dispatcher Vince Coleman stayed at

11
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:20,260
his telegraph to stop the trains.

12
00:00:20,490 --> 00:00:22,000
He died at his post.

13
00:00:23,747 --> 00:00:26,267
At 9:04, Mont-Blanc exploded:

14
00:00:26,267 --> 00:00:28,347
the largest man-made blast the

15
00:00:28,347 --> 00:00:30,017
world had ever seen.

16
00:00:31,234 --> 00:00:33,634
Nearly everything within 800 metres

17
00:00:33,634 --> 00:00:34,874
was flattened.

18
00:00:34,874 --> 00:00:38,464
At least 1,782 people died.

19
00:00:39,934 --> 00:00:41,764
Every year since 1971,

20
00:00:41,764 --> 00:00:44,094
Nova Scotia has sent Boston

21
00:00:44,094 --> 00:00:45,054
a Christmas tree.

22
00:00:45,054 --> 00:00:47,164
It still says thank you.
